  "description": "White upper fuselage over a dark-blue belly from the nose aft; behind the rear door the blue sweeps up to the crown and takes the whole tail cone. An orange band with a white pinstripe and a thin orange line rises from the dorsal fin onto the fin's root; the rest of the fin white with a blue half-sunburst of rays. 'SunExpress' in blue above the forward windows, the sun roundel by the nose, 'sunexpress.com' big on the belly and in white on the dark-blue engines.",
